# Text files are stored with LF in the repository and checked out with the
# platform line endings (CRLF on Windows via core.autocrlf).
# Do not use "eol=crlf" here: it makes Dependabot commit CRLF blobs back into
# the repository, which then show up as permanently modified files locally.
*.txt text
*.cs text
*.sln text
*.config text
*.targets text
*.resx text
*.csproj text
*.settings text
